  (text "HOUR METER main board rev B (chip-down, JLCPCB in-stock parts)\nOne sheet per former module: Power input, Opto inputs (817 2ch), RS485 (MAX485), ESP32 core + USB (DevKitC),\nRTC (DS3231), EEPROM (AT24C256, DIP socket), IMU (MPU9250 -> MPU-6500 + LIS3MDL), Ports (UART, GPS, Qwiic, expansion).\nSheet pins join by net name (labels at every pin). +5V, +3V3 and GND are global power symbols.\nThe board runs from 5 V; the 9-36 V supply is the plug-on PSU-B board (schematic/hour-meter-psu-b) on J102.\nReference designators are numbered per sheet: 1xx power, 2xx core, 3xx opto, 4xx RTC, 5xx EEPROM, 6xx IMU, 7xx RS485, 8xx ports."
    (at 40 256 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bfe5a987-51d5-4e6d-9df1-a5c8be161feb")
  )
)
